1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:06,430
Moving your books off an old
desktop system is a financial

2
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,890
trust problem, not a file copy.

3
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:12,590
MoveBooks AI guides that
move in five stages.

4
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:17,650
Rules check every figure and every
decision that matters stays with you.

5
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,670
Start on the MoveBooks home page.

6
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,350
You can explore the
demo without signing in.

7
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:26,910
It runs on Harbor Light Books, a
small sample bookshop, and every

8
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,270
record in it is synthetic.

9
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:32,470
This beta never connects to an
accounting provider, so don't

10
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:33,910
bring real customer data.

11
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:37,470
To keep your progress,
choose Enter demo workspace.

12
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:40,470
If you're new, you start
with the sample business.

13
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:44,430
If you're returning, your migration
resumes where you left off.

14
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:46,670
My migration is your home base.

15
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:49,580
The bar across the top
shows the five stages.

16
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:52,170
Understand checks readiness.

17
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:55,850
Prepare maps every record
and asks for your approval.

18
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:58,350
Move transfers records in batches.

19
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:03,650
Verify compares the old and new
books to the cent and start posts and

20
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:05,110
verifies your first invoice.

21
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:09,890
Every screen shows what's
done, what's waiting on you and

22
00:01:09,890 --> 00:01:13,970
your one next step. Evidence
and help are always a click away

23
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:18,190
and later stages stay locked
until the one before is complete.

24
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:20,370
Begin where every move should.

25
00:01:20,910 --> 00:01:24,170
Open, understand and check
whether your books are ready.
